<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Equinox shares up on Gawler propsect.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Equinox shares up on Gawler propsect.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Equinox Resources NL rose sharply in early trading on Thursday, supported by significant gold anomalies intersected at the Bimba prospect within the Gawler Craton mine region of South Australia, traders said.</p>
<p>At 0010 GMT (11.10 a.m.), Equinox shares were 11 cents higher at 84 cents on turnover of 771,940.</p>
<p>Exploration is being conducted under a joint venture between Equinox and Phelps Dodge Australasia Pty Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
